'MicroCFTA.SourceCurrentAllocatedMkEdge.build' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
'MicroCFTA.SourceCurrentAllocatedMkEdge.reject' does not depend on any axioms
'MicroCFTA.SourceCurrentAllocatedMkEdge.finite' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
'MicroCFTA.SourceCurrentAllocatedMkEdge.build_contradictory' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
'MicroCFTA.SourceCurrentAllocatedMkEdge.reject_correct' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
'MicroCFTA.SourceCurrentAllocatedMkEdge.RejectReceipt.empty' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
